, "type": "VAELoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [330, 60], "pos": [5030, 1090], "id": 12, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"vae_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [85], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [280, 50], "pos": [5410, 1180], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 16, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 17, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.4.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#4a7b4a", "widgets_values": ["模型地址：\nhttps://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\n型号：选择您的 DiT 型号\n\n3B 型号：速度更快，显存需求更低\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensorsFP8 8位（高质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.ggufGGUF 8 位量化（高质量）\n\n7B 型号：画质更高，显存需求更高\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors：FP8，最后一个数据块使用FP16，以减少伪影（质量良好）\n\nseedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_*：锐化版本，增强细节\n设备：用于 DiT 推理的 GPU 设备（例如，cuda:0）\n\noffload_device：当 DiT 模型不处于活跃处理状态时，用于卸载 DiT 模型的设备\n\nnone：将模型保存在推理设备（速度最快、显存最大的设备）上\ncpu：卸载到系统内存（减少显存）\ncuda:X：将负载转移到另一块GPU（如果可用，则可获得良好的负载均衡）\ncache_model：在工作流运行之间，保持卸载设备上的 DiT 模型加载状态\n\n适用于批量处理，避免重复加载\n需要设置 offload_device\nblocks_to_swap：块交换内存优化\n\n0：已禁用（默认）\n1-32：需要替换为 3B 型号的变压器模块数量\n1-36：需要更换为 7B 型号的变压器模块数量\n数值越高，节省的显存越多，但处理速度越慢。\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335533", "size": [990, 350], "pos": [5010, 1360], "id": 36, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [790, 1080], "pos": [6010, 630], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 85, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 66, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 24}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.35.9", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-5722.34080782865, -474.77774261566515], "scale": 0.6588450000000072}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "模型加载", "bounding": [5010, 600, 370, 720]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "用户参数", "bounding": [4730, 600, 270, 530]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "新采样器工作区", "bounding": [5390, 600, 610, 720]}, {"color": "#b36cf9", "font_size": 160, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "🦁Z-image 二次元拆解专属lora+提取人物特征", "bounding": [3400, 360, 3400, 1350]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 10, "title": "原